# 📄 Product Requirements Document (PRD)

## 🎯 Project Name: Event Management & Participation Platform

---

## 🧩 1. Overview

এই সিস্টেমটি একটি full-stack web application যেখানে users event তৈরি করতে পারবে, অন্যরা join করতে পারবে (free/paid/private), এবং পুরো lifecycle admin দ্বারা নিয়ন্ত্রিত হবে।

Platform টি তিন ধরনের user support করবে:

* **User (Participant / Creator)**
* **Admin**
* **Event Owner (User-এর subset)**

---

## 🎯 2. Objectives

* Users যেন সহজে event create ও manage করতে পারে
* Participants যেন বিভিন্ন ধরনের event-এ join করতে পারে
* Secure authentication ও role-based authorization নিশ্চিত করা
* Admin যেন পুরো system monitor ও control করতে পারে
* Future payment integration ready রাখা

---

## 👥 3. User Roles & Permissions

### 🔹 User

* Register & Login
* Profile manage
* Event create & manage (own events only)
* Events join (free/paid/private)
* Review দিতে পারবে

### 🔹 Event Owner

* Own events update/delete
* Participants approve/reject/ban
* Invite users

### 🔹 Admin

* All users manage
* Events approve/reject
* Force delete events
* Ban users

---

## 🔐 4. Functional Modules

---

## 4.1 Auth Module

### Features:

* User Registration
* Login (JWT based authentication)
* বর্তমান user info পাওয়া
* Password change

### Endpoints:

* POST `/auth/register`
* POST `/auth/login`
* GET `/auth/me`
* POST `/auth/change-password`

---

## 👤 4.2 User Module

### Features:

* User listing (Admin only)
* Profile view (নিজের বা admin)
* Profile update
* User ban/delete

### Key Logic Insight:

* `/users/:id` ব্যবহার করা হয় flexibility এর জন্য
* নিজের profile update করলে backend এ token থেকে id extract করা উচিত (secure approach)

### Endpoints:

* GET `/users` (Admin)
* GET `/users/:id`
* PATCH `/users/:id`
* DELETE `/users/:id`
* PATCH `/users/ban/:id`

---

## 🎉 4.3 Event Module (Core)

### Features:

* Public event browse
* Event details view
* Event create/update/delete
* Admin approval system

### Event Status Flow:

* PENDING → APPROVED / REJECTED

### Endpoints:

#### Public:

* GET `/events`
* GET `/events/:id`

#### User:

* POST `/events`
* PATCH `/events/:id`
* DELETE `/events/:id`
* GET `/events/my-events`

#### Admin:

* PATCH `/events/status/:id`
* DELETE `/events/admin/:id`

---

## 🧾 4.4 Registration Module (Critical Module)

### Features:

* Free event join
* Paid event join request
* Private event join request
* Invitation system
* Participant approval system

### Join Types:

* Free → Direct join
* Paid → Payment required
* Private → Approval required

### Endpoints:

#### Join:

* POST `/registrations/join/:eventId`
* POST `/registrations/pay-join/:eventId`
* POST `/registrations/request/:eventId`

#### Invitation:

* POST `/registrations/invite`
* PATCH `/registrations/accept/:id`
* PATCH `/registrations/reject/:id`

#### Owner Controls:

* PATCH `/registrations/approve/:id`
* PATCH `/registrations/reject/:id`
* PATCH `/registrations/ban/:id`

#### View:

* GET `/registrations/event/:eventId`
* GET `/registrations/my`

---

## ⭐ 4.5 Review Module

### Features:

* Event review create
* Reviews দেখানো
* Update/Delete review

### Constraints:

* User শুধুমাত্র joined event এ review দিতে পারবে

### Endpoints:

* POST `/reviews`
* GET `/reviews/event/:eventId`
* PATCH `/reviews/:id`
* DELETE `/reviews/:id`

---

## 💳 4.6 Payment Module (Future Ready)

### Features:

* Payment initiate
* Payment সফল/ব্যর্থ callback handle

### Note:

* এখন minimal রাখা হবে (mock or basic integration)

### Endpoints:

* POST `/payments/initiate`
* POST `/payments/success`
* POST `/payments/fail`

---

## 📊 4.7 Dashboard Module (Optional but Valuable)

### Features:

* Overview stats
* My events
* Pending invitations

### Endpoints:

* GET `/dashboard/overview`
* GET `/dashboard/my-events`
* GET `/dashboard/invitations`

---

## ⚙️ 5. System Architecture

### Backend Stack:

* Node.js + Express
* Prisma ORM
* PostgreSQL
* JWT Authentication

### Structure Pattern:

* Modular Architecture
* পরিষ্কার separation: Controller → Service → Validation

---

## 🧱 6. Error Handling Strategy

Centralized error handling system:

* Custom Error (`AppError`)
* Prisma error handler
* Zod validation error handler
* Global error middleware

---

## 🧪 7. Validation

* Zod-based request validation
* Middleware: `validateRequest`

---

## 🔐 8. Security Considerations

* JWT ভিত্তিক authentication
* Role-based authorization
* Sensitive route protection
* Input validation

---

## 🚀 9. Future Enhancements

* Full payment gateway integration (Stripe / SSLCommerz)
* Real-time notifications
* Email system (invite, approval)
* Event analytics
* Mobile app support

---

## ✅ 10. Success Criteria

* Users successfully event create করতে পারছে
* Participants বিভিন্ন event join করতে পারছে
* Admin efficiently system control করতে পারছে
* Secure authentication & authorization কাজ করছে

---

## 🧠 Final Note

এই PRD অনুযায়ী build করলে project টা production-level architecture follow করবে।
Particularly Registration module আর Event approval system এই project-এর backbone — এগুলা clean logic দিয়ে implement করা সবচেয়ে critical।


src/
├── errors/
│   ├── AppError.ts
│   ├── handlePrismaError.ts
│   ├── handlePrismaValidationError.ts
│   └── handleZodError.ts
├── interface/
│   ├── error.interface.ts
│   └── index.d.ts           // Express namespace এবং Request user টাইপ এখানে থাকবে
├── middlewares/
│   ├── auth.ts
│   ├── globalErrorHandler.ts
│   ├── notFound.ts
│   └── validateRequest.ts
├── utils/
│   ├── catchAsync.ts
│   └── sendResponse.ts
└── server.ts                // বা app.ts যেখানে এগুলো কানেক্ট হবে


